[{"id":"1266178106093641728","date":1590715359000,"rawContent":"#BlackLivesMatter I think of Sam Free. He was in my little redneck town of Otisville NY. I was very young. He was the child of freed slaves. Hence, the name.\n\nHe drove very slow at age 103 around town in the 70s. \n\nThink about that. It's 155 years after the Civil War and WTF.","media":null,"username":"geo_walters","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266944374824468480","date":1590898052000,"rawContent":"I sat down my 16 year old boy. Told him what was going on.\n\nFor years, been telling him we are all equal.\n\nNow I am telling him black people get screwed. \n\nHe can be the force, the helper, to de-escalate where someone is in trouble.\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"geo_walters","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":3,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1267438795571499009","date":1591015931000,"rawContent":"#BlackLivesMatter and these other agitators are taking away and causing problems for... the true aggrieved.\n\nI wish the white women from upstate, the Brooklyn Lawyers, and so many other agitators would stop causing trouble.\n\nI know many are hurting. Justice takes too long.","media":null,"username":"geo_walters","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":4,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"su